  "title": "IBCSO: International Bathymetric Chart of the Southern Ocean",
  "description": "Cloud-optimized copies of the International Bathymetric Chart of the Southern Ocean grids, with virtual multidimensional indexes (GDAL VRT, Kerchunk, Icechunk, STAC). 500 m polar stereographic grids south of 50\u00b0S: bed and ice surface elevation, with source and type identifiers. Holds Version 1.0 (doi:10.1594/PANGAEA.805734), Version 2 (doi:10.1594/PANGAEA.937574) and archived snapshots of the rolling annual releases, each under its own prefix, with georeferenced copies of the printed charts. Repackaged from the AWI and IBCSO releases, CC BY 4.0 (Version 1.0: CC BY 3.0). Not for navigation.\r\n",
